Subject: Expose the original initialization prefix for incremental native startup

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Retain the entire original main.cpp initialization, task priorities and game
loop. Only native builds omit MWCC PowerPC GQR assembly; native animation
decoders are selected separately by patch0019. Add a separate selected-source
diagnostic prefix without modifying the original entry's game logic or globals.
The diagnostic prefix and full entry must not be linked together.

